<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 174.55 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 174.55 mln rand S.Africa bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 174.55 million rand worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling a net 61.87 million rand on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27</p>
</text>
